{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24436","headline":"和杨六尚书喜两弟汉公转吴兴鲁士赐章服命宾开宴用庆恩荣赋长句见示 · 白居易","name":"和杨六尚书喜两弟汉公转吴兴鲁士赐章服命宾开宴用庆恩荣赋长句见示","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"华筵贺客日纷纷，劒外欢娱洛下闻。\n朱绂宠光新照地，彤襜喜气远凌云。\n荣联花萼诗难和，乐助埙箎酒易[醺]。\n感羡料应知我意，今生此事不如君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24436.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24436","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}